    "_comment": "Contract calls sent from the Native lane as one hybrid-signed MsgCrossVMCall each, with no EVM window (decisions 0026, 0030). true = that job uses this route; false = it sends EVM transactions through its scoped window, and the demo status then says whether that window is live. The fee is the whole gas limit at nativeLane.gasPriceUqor. retireGas: Mentari.retire used 1009253 gas this way (case H). caseGas: the failure buttons, at the 1500000 limit cases B to D had on the EVM lane. grantGas: Mentari.transfer, which makes no bridge call. attestGas: Mentari.attest used 640824 to 641121 gas this way (case H step 1 and the first two daily runs, decision 0031). revertCodespace: the codespace of an EVM revert inside a Native call (case H step 1, code 14); any other failure is not reported as the expected revert.",
